  ╭ Keyboard guide ──────────────────────────────╮
  │                                              │
  │    Enter send   Ctrl+J new line              │
  │    Ctrl+N new Session                        │
  │    Ctrl+S open Sessions                      │
  │    Ctrl+P open commands                      │
  │    Ctrl+R open prompt history                │
  │    Ctrl+G edit externally                    │
  │    Ctrl+U/K kill to line edge                │
  │    Ctrl+Y yank killed text                   │
  │    Esc close guide   Ctrl+Q ask to quit      │
  │                                              │
